ather than a bane?<br /> <br /> I see it as a bane, because inevitably the second dirge is pushing a character towards becoming a monster. To me, that is not a gift.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> And the fact that you can pretty safely ignore it, when it would mean getting big trouble with it. (Common sense/self preservation defeating ones beliefs of what is good or right isn't too far out there). So basically, what you give players, is a Dirge to be used. another tool. It's like giving them a free power <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-17T16:28:13-08:00","id":788388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Griautis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/425506-bloodline-childer-of-the-morrigan?p=427543#post427543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> And the fact that you can pretty safely ignore it, when it would mean getting big trouble with it. (Common sense/self preservation defeating ones beliefs of what is good or right isn't too far out there). So basically, what you give players, is a Dirge to be used. another tool. It's like giving them a free power <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I see your point with this. Makes sense in that view.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4812-karhu_fueryon","name":"karhu_fueryon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4812_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-17T16:28:53-08:00","id":788390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murder_of_Craws</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/425506-bloodline-childer-of-the-morrigan?p=427424#post427424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of my favorite bloodlines, I like it very much. One question on the Murder of Crows devotion, wouldn't it be the same as the Swarm Form Merit (VTR 2e, pg. 114), or would there be something to differentiate it?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I believe I had this conversation with one of my players, on top of Swarm Form.. you get the Murder of Crows. Basically, two instead of just one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4812-karhu_fueryon","name":"karhu_fueryon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4812_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}